=== 3. PAIRED COMPARISONS ON THE SAME 143 ROWS (exact McNemar) ===
McNemar is the right test here: both models see the identical cases, so only the
discordant pairs carry information. Reported as an exact binomial test on b+c.
  XGB rfe12 unscaled     140/143
  XGB all30 unscaled     138/143
  LogReg rfe12 scaled    141/143
  SVMlin rfe12 scaled    141/143
  ExtraTrees rfe12       140/143
  RF all30 unscaled      139/143
  KNN20 all30            138/143
  PCA12 XGB scaled       138/143
  pairs:
     XGB rfe12 unscaled     vs XGB all30 unscaled      b  1 c  1  exact p 1.000
